//*     eEName          Usage
//*    ----------       -------------------------
//*    ENAME_NAME       (1) the AS of result set column
//*                     (2) COLUMN= of an UPDATE
//*
//*    ENAME_TAB        DB.TABLE.NAME used to resolve names
//*                     of subqueries
//*
//*    ENAME_SPAN       Text of the original result set
//*                     expression.
