//* type of join.  Return an integer constant that expresses that type
//* in terms of the following bit values:
//*
//*     JT_INNER
//*     JT_CROSS
//*     JT_OUTER
//*     JT_NATURAL
//*     JT_LEFT
//*     JT_RIGHT
